							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16686#msg16686">Quote from: Shakro on April 29, 2005, 10:30:59 am</a></div><div class="quote">I&#039;d say you guys are tied at DoN progression up until the point that someone kills a new dragon. </div><br />We dropped Rikkukin the Defender last night also. /shrug  Nice farmage. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" />
