	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16693"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=868" title="View the profile of Shrek">Shrek</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 19<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=868"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16693#msg16693"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16693#msg16693">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2779 on:</b> April 29, 2005, 04:11:05 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Progression is linear.&nbsp; There are no side steps. <br /></div><br />That&#039;s silly, progression has had &quot;side steps&quot; since kunark.&nbsp; I&#039;m not sure how long you&#039;ve been around but I&#039;m sure you&#039;ve done PoP.&nbsp; Once you access Air/Earth/Water, you have a significant side step, either do SolRo for Fire, or work on those three.<br /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">It doesn&#039;t make them the top guild on the server, but it does put them first in progression.<br /></div><br />Only if you are equal in progression up to that point, and the target you killed was somehow more difficult than previous progression.&nbsp; <br /><br />As an example...<br />Guild A did all of Luclin but VT, and whacks Grummus...<br />Guild B did all of Luclin and VT, did not whack Grummus...<br /><br />You skipped a large chunk of content to do something the other guild could obviously do.&nbsp; It&#039;s like running a race, you don&#039;t get to skip lap 3 of 4 and get to claim you win.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">And for the record, no, I don&#039;t have balls, nor do I have any plans to grow them...<br /></div>You also don&#039;t have a yellow-stripe running down your back, but you know what the symbolism means.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">however, I don&#039;t hide behind fake names.&nbsp; My game name (and gender...) are on the left of my post.<br /></div><br />Last I checked my name was not fake, and your gender is irrelevant.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
